### AI-Era Backend API Tests
### Use with REST Client extension (REST Client by Huachao Mao)

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = Bearer demo

---

### ============================================
### DIRECT PATH TESTS (No AI involved)
### ============================================

### GET all orders (direct microservice call)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: {{token}}

---

### GET all users (direct microservice call)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: {{token}}

---

### POST create payment (direct microservice call)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "from": "alice",
  "to": "bob"
}

---

### ============================================
### AI PATH TESTS (Through Python agent)
### ============================================

### Query: Get all orders (AI path - simple)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/query
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Get me all orders"
}

---

### Query: Get all users (AI path)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/query
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Show me all users"
}

---

### Query: Get orders and users (AI path - multiple tools)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/query
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Show me all orders and users, how many of each are there?"
}

---

### Query: Complex request with context
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/query
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "List all payment information and orders",
  "context": "We need to reconcile transactions"
}

---

### Query: With custom session ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/query
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Get all orders",
  "session_id": "session-123-abc"
}

---

### ============================================
### POLLING FOR TASK RESULTS
### ============================================

### Poll task result (replace TASK_ID with actual task_id from response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/50bd8a7e-add0-4999-9b35-6e7f56ac2334
Authorization: {{token}}

---

### ============================================
### ERROR CASES
### ============================================

### Missing authorization header (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

---

### Missing required prompt field (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/query
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "test-123"
}

---

### Token limit exceeded (very long prompt, should fail with 413)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/query
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit."
}

---

### Nonexistent task ID (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/nonexistent-task-id
Authorization: {{token}}

---

### ============================================
### WORKFLOW EXAMPLES
### ============================================

### Step 1: Submit AI query and capture task_id
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/query
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Get me all orders and users"
}

### Step 2: Poll result (use task_id from Step 1 response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{task_id_from_step_1}
Authorization: {{token}}

---

### Health check (if implemented)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Authorization: {{token}}

---
